  "body": "Set in a sought-after Silverdale neighbourhood, this contemporary two-level residence sits on an approximately 242sqm section and offers a thoughtfully designed 168.5sqm (approx.) floor plan that prioritises space, light, and practical modern living.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is thoughtfully designed with flexibility and everyday ease in mind. A well-appointed open-plan kitchen, living, and dining area forms the central hub of the home. The modern kitchen features sleek finishes, quality cabinetry, and generous bench space. This seamless space flows effortlessly to the outdoor deck, creating an ideal setting for relaxed entertaining and indoor-outdoor living. \r\n\r\nThis level also includes one bedroom and a full bathroom, offering excellent versatility for guests, extended family, or work-from-home needs. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home shifts into a more private and relaxed setting. An additional living area provides a comfortable space for family time or a quiet retreat. The master bedroom is generously sized and complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while two additional bedrooms are supported by a well-designed family bathroom. The layout is both functional and balanced, catering easily to modern family needs.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nA single internal-access garage with a laundry nook\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\nIntercom\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly desirable Silverdale community, this home places you moments from everything you need. Enjoy easy walking access to Hibiscus Coast Station, Park & Ride, along with convenient proximity to Pak'nSave Silverdale, Silverdale Mall, KingsWay School, Northern Arena, local cafés, and parks. Excellent motorway connections ensure an effortless commute, while the setting offers the perfect balance of suburban peace and modern convenience-an ideal lifestyle for today's families.\r\n\r\nOffering a practical layout, low-maintenance design, and strong lifestyle appeal, this property presents an excellent opportunity for families, professionals, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nA smart step into modern Silverdale living - Contact Team Sabrina today to arrange your viewing.",
